Phase 2 is complete. The findings report is at `collab/1788953799216-storage-space-transactor-phase2.glm-5.3.findings.md`; nothing staged or committed.

## What landed (one coherent swap, as the plan required)

**Source (3 files)**
- `transactor.cljc` — rewritten: `DaoStreamLog`/`ds/defopen`/v1 require all deleted; `create!` (surfaces-never-retention validation, `derive-next-t`, returns the value or throws), `append-packet!` per D3 (`valid-outcome?` before interpreting, advance-on-ok-only, non-ok as data, non-outcome folded to `transport-error`), `append!`/`transact!`/`close!` as plain functions answering `closed` as data, no `next`/`closed?`
- `index.cljc` — `snapshot-datoms` is D6's loop: `checked` (validate-outcome) on the mint and every read, incremental `element-datoms`, no gap branch, totality throw
- `schema.cljc` — D8's seven edits: `tx/create!`, wrapper-owned `:closed` flag, install-state-only-on-ok + D10 re-wrap to `{:result :ok :t … :datoms …}`, `publish!` guard under the wrapper lock

**Tests** — all five doubles + 22 local opens migrated; the gap fixtures deleted (§7); three new `MalformedResultStream` sub-cases (ok-without-cursor throws-not-spins, conforming `gap`/`cursor-mismatch` hit the totality throw); two new schema tests (T19/T20 state-unchanged-on-`full`, T8 publish/close lock extension). Also fixed a latent v1 bug: `ThrowingAppendStream`'s retry was appending `#'clojure.core/val` (unbound `val`) — invisible because no assertion read the stream.

**Docs** — 7 files including the new permanent `docs/design/dao.space.transactor.md` (T-table, D3 outcome table, T18, durability placement, O(history) open item).

